尽管写信给我们，
我们很想知道。
Write to us.
We want to know about it.

280
00:13:48,100 --> 00:13:53,600
大家可以登录网站
bbc.co.ukford/topgear……等等，啥？
And you can go to the website
bbc.co.ukford/topgear... What?

281
00:13:53,633 --> 00:13:56,000
-非常好，你竟然记住了。
-搞定！
-It's very good.
You remembered it.
-That's it!

282
00:13:56,033 --> 00:13:57,933
话说回来，既然聊到观众来信，
Now. talking of
getting in touch,

283
00:13:57,967 --> 00:14:00,833
上期节目播完后，
有不少观众联系我们投诉。
we had a number of people
after last week's show
got in touch to complain.

284
