No, no, no. No. I'm sorry
we didn't burn more caravans.

296
00:14:32,967 --> 00:14:35,467
你说得太对了，我也是！
没错，确实是。
You're right, so am I!
Yeah, that's true.

297
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:39,533
好了言归正传，我想聊聊保时捷911。
Right, now, I want to talk
about the Porsche 911.

298
00:14:39,567 --> 00:14:44,533
听着，这辆车的设计初衷，
就是在物理定律允许的极限下跑得尽可能快。
Okay, now this is designed
to be as fast as the laws of
physics allow.

299
00:14:44,567 --> 00:14:46,467
这固然很棒。
And that's great.

300
00:14:46,467 --> 00:14:50,067
但它未免太严肃了，
几乎没什么幽默感可言。
But it's rather a serious car.
It doesn't have much of
a sense of humour.

301
00:14:50,100 --> 00:14:52,900
法拉利430也是一个德行。
And it's the same story
with the Ferrari 430.

302
00:14:52,933 --> 00:14:56,300
吃晚饭时，你绝对不会想坐在
这种车主的旁边，
You really don't want to sit
next to someone at dinner
who's got one

