Lamborghinis are for people
who want to move about
in a big pantomime,

306
00:15:19,167 --> 00:15:23,767
就像一部场面恢弘的西区音乐剧，
充斥着炫目的色彩和喧嚣的轰鸣，
a massive West End musical
full of colour and noise,

307
00:15:23,800 --> 00:15:27,333
至于过弯能有多快？去它的吧！
and to hell with how fast
you can go round a corner.

308
00:15:30,767 --> 00:15:36,233
遗憾的是，Gallardo——这辆“小兰博”，
